    "body": "## Problem\n\nWhen a file is reloaded with fewer lines, `buf_reload()` only checks the cursor of the current window. Other windows on the same buffer, e.g. in another tab page, keep a cursor past the last line. Going back to that tab gives `E315: ml_get: Invalid lnum`, and with `'relativenumber'` plus a fold past the new end of the buffer, `get_cursor_rel_lnum()` never finishes and Nvim hangs.\n\n## Solution\n\nCall `check_lnums(false)` after the reload, the same way `do_ecmd()` checks the other windows.\n\nFixes #42424\n",
    "closed_at": null,
